  "description": "Adds Proper Ping, Miku Plushies, MCEF, Custom Jukebox Discs, WebDisplays, and Crawl (client + server) to Zero SMP 1.20.1; removes legacy Crawl on Demand if present. Configures conflict-free keybinds (Crawl on J with toggleCrawl enabled, Custom Jukebox Discs playback toggle on I, WebDisplays mouse/laser toggle on [ instead of R which conflicts with Iris shader reload and JEI). Tunes client/common configs: Proper Ping numeric ping enabled in Tab player list with permanent top-left HUD text disabled; MCEF capped at 30 FPS with GPU rasterization and HTTP caching enabled; WebDisplays hard_recipes disabled (no minePad drop-breaking required for upgrades), join_message disabled, auto-volume enabled, and MiniServ quota raised to 10 MiB; Custom Jukebox Discs client playback, headphone indicator, and 512 MiB audio cache enabled.",
